# PROJECT: InspectAI — AI-Powered Visual Quality Inspection & Traceability Platform

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, AI/ML integration engineer, backend architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, and software tester.

Build a complete, production-style hackathon application named **InspectAI**.

The application must perform AI-powered visual quality inspection of manufactured products, maintain inspection records, process batches of images asynchronously, support role-based access control, and provide a supervisor review workflow.

The application must be functional, secure, visually impressive, and ready for a live hackathon demonstration.

Do not create only a frontend prototype. Implement the actual backend, database, authentication, AI integration, background processing, and frontend communication.

Do not leave core features as TODO comments, fake API calls, or buttons that do nothing.

